NOTE: area_cv and mean_area compare COVERAGE, and v1's matte is over-inclusive on at least ipman and butter, so a v2 loss in these columns is not a quality result. Run bench/score_disagreement.py against the persisted alphas before making any v2-vs-v1 claim.
